;;; EXERCISE

#|
Create a structure where the 4 parameters are controlled 
with weighted-random.
Use gen-weight and length-weight.
Filter the output in a score for flute and bass-clarinet
by using ambitus-filter.
Integrate other functions if necessary.
|#

